#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001f
msgid ""
"Accept our offer, and we wil allow you \n"
"to retain control of MSF and ZEKE."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000020
msgid "That's... an offer?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000021
msgid ""
"The Boss threw down her gun, \n"
"and with it her life's calling."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000022
msgid ""
"You - her disciple - have never been \n"
"able to do that. You are too afraid to let go."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000023
msgid "I was made to fight. I am a gun."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000024
msgid ""
"Is that so?! Then what do you call this?\n"
"Is it a gun, too?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000025
msgid ""
"You are a lousy liar! Admit it - this thing is \n"
"a monstrosity, a product of your own fear!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000026
msgid ""
"But not Cipher! \n"
"Cipher thought of something different. "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000027
msgid "Cipher's going to control guns."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000028
msgid "Control guns?"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000029
msgid "That is right. Not deter, control. It is the ultimate approach to the illusion of peace..."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002a
msgid "Control power? You're gonna be disappointed."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002b
msgid "Then we are done! Thank you for playing! "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002c
msgid ""
"Better luck next time. The offer is rescinded! \n"
"And now, the ultimatum."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002d
msgid "ZEKE is already in nuclear strike mode."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002f
msgid ""
"I'm taking the weapon you built and using it\n"
"to launch a nuclear strike"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000030
msgid "on the east coast of the United States!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000031
msgid "You're insane! What are you after?!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000032
msgid "But wait, here is your consolation prize:"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000033
msgid ""
"We are about to show the world just \n"
"how dangerous a gang of outlaws"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000034
msgid " - an army without borders - can be!"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000035
msgid ""
"You and your men will become pariahs,\n"
"and you will be wiped off the face of the earth."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000036
msgid ""
"Rather than heroes, you will be seen \n"
"as a well-armed, extremist cult"
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000037
msgid ""
"prone to indiscriminate outbursts \n"
"of nuclear aggression."
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000038
msgid "You will give rise to a new world order, "
msgstr ""

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000039
msgid ""
"an age of deterrence defined by its fear of\n"
"extremist cult influence."
msgstr "一个恐惧极端教派影响力的\n威慑时代。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003a
msgid "Do you like the picture I am painting, Big Boss?!"
msgstr "喜欢我画的这幅图吗，BIG BOSS？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003b
msgid ""
"When all is said and done, \n"
"peace is nothing but a fantasy! "
msgstr "说到底，\n和平不过是幻想！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003c
msgid "A game's a game! You either win or you lose!"
msgstr "游戏就是游戏！不是赢就是输！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003d
msgid "All you can do is fight!"
msgstr "你只能战斗！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003e
#: slot/0x00db94df/0x3564e1/0x000000
msgid "Stop me if you can!"
msgstr "有本事就来阻止我！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00003f
msgid "The peace sign is the \"V\" of victory!"
msgstr "和平手势就是胜利的\"V\"！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000040
msgid "Say PEACE!"
msgstr "说\"和平\"！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000000
msgid "It is no use, ZEKE is out of my control. "
msgstr "没用，吉克不受我控了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000001
msgid "This is where it ends."
msgstr "到此为止了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000002
msgid "Listen to me, Big Boss... "
msgstr "听我说，BIG BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000003
msgid ""
"As long as your army is needed,\n"
"the world will never know true peace."
msgstr "只要还需要你的军队，\n世界就永无真正和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000004
msgid ""
"The peace you will know will be fleeting - illusory.\n"
"They will use you, disgrace you, "
msgstr "你所知的和平转瞬即逝——虚幻不实。\n他们会利用你，羞辱你，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000005
msgid ""
"and then, finally, discard you \n"
"like they would a cancer to society."
msgstr "最后，像丢弃社会的毒瘤一样\n将你抛弃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000006
msgid "This is the path you have chosen!"
msgstr "这就是你选择的道路！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b060d/0x39a173/0x000007
msgid "Paz..."
msgstr "帕兹……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000000
msgid "How's it going?"
msgstr "怎么样？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000001
msgid "How's ZEKE look?"
msgstr "吉克怎样？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000002
msgid ""
"The attitude control AI had a backup,\n"
"so... it should be able to walk."
msgstr "姿态控制AI有备份，\n所以……应该能走。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000003
msgid "Really... That's good."
msgstr "是吗……那太好了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000004
msgid "Beyond that, it's up to the creator..."
msgstr "此外就看创造者了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000005
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "站住！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000006
msgid "Don't come any closer, doctor."
msgstr "别再靠近了，博士。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000007
msgid "There's something I've been meaning to ask you..."
msgstr "有件事我一直想问你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000008
msgid "Do you..."
msgstr "你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000009
msgid "do you despise me?"
msgstr "你讨厌我吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000a
msgid "Doctor, are you asking me out?"
msgstr "医生，你是在约我吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000b
msgid "No no, not at all..."
msgstr "不不，完全不是……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000c
msgid "No?"
msgstr "不是吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000d
msgid "Pity..."
msgstr "真遗憾……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x00000e
msgid ""
"Because I've just had \n"
"my heart broken by someone else."
msgstr "因为我刚被别人\n伤了心。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000010
msgid "I only like those who can stand on their own."
msgstr "我只喜欢能独立自主的人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000011
msgid "If you fancy me, then come walk with me."
msgstr "要是你中意我，就跟我来吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000012
msgid "Who knows what miracles might happen?"
msgstr "谁知道会发生什么奇迹呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000013
msgid "Love is blind, after all."
msgstr "毕竟爱情盲目。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000014
msgid "Take your time... "
msgstr "慢慢来……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b0612/0x79a1a9/0x000015
msgid "I'll be waiting..."
msgstr "我会等你的……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000000
msgid "Meow! Don't point that funky weapon at me-ow!"
msgstr "喵！别拿那怪武器指着我喵！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000001
msgid "A talking cat...?"
msgstr "会说话的猫……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000002
msgid ""
"Hey, you wouldn't happen to be a hunter, \n"
"would you?"
msgstr "嘿，你该不会正好是个猎人吧，\n对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000003
msgid "Me, I'm Trenya. Purr-eased to meet you."
msgstr "我叫Trenya，幸会喵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000004
msgid "Trenya?"
msgstr "Trenya？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000005
msgid "That's what I said. If you're a hunter,"
msgstr "没错。如果你是猎人，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000006
msgid ""
"I can take you to an island \n"
"where there're lots of rare creatures."
msgstr "我能带你去一座\n有很多稀有生物的岛。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000007
msgid "I bet you'd get a kick out of hunting them, meow."
msgstr "我打赌你一定会猎得很过瘾，喵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000008
msgid "Creatures...? Even rarer than a talking cat?"
msgstr "生物？比会说话的猫还稀有？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000009
msgid ""
"Nothing gets by you...\n"
"But, no! There're even bigger ones on the island. "
msgstr "瞒不过你……\n不过不对！岛上还有更大的家伙。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000a
msgid "Huge monsters, meow!"
msgstr "大怪物，喵！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000b
msgid "Monsters?!"
msgstr "怪物？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000c
msgid "A hunter like you can't possibly pass this up!"
msgstr "你这样的猎人绝不会错过！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000d
msgid "Sorry, kitty, but I'm no hunter."
msgstr "抱歉，小猫，我不是猎人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000e
msgid "Whaa?! Oh, man... "
msgstr "啥？！天哪……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x00000f
msgid ""
"I saw that killer look in your eye and thought \n"
"you were special somehow, meow."
msgstr "我看到你眼中的杀意，还以为 \n你有多特别呢，喵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x32ad74/0x000010
msgid "...Not exactly ordinary yourself."
msgstr "……你也不普通。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000000
msgid ""
"Sigh... Over hill and over dale, \n"
"through rain and snow"
msgstr "唉……翻山越岭，\n风雨无阻"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000001
msgid ""
"I come all the way out here \n"
"from Pokke Farm to find work,"
msgstr "我从波凯农场大老远跑来\n找活干，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000002
msgid "and not a single customer so far... "
msgstr "结果到现在一个客人也没有……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000003
msgid "Not to be rude, but I've got things to do."
msgstr "不是失礼，但我还有事忙。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000004
msgid ""
"So if you need someone to go monster hunting\n"
"with you, find someone else."
msgstr "所以你要是想找人陪你猎怪，\n另请高明吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000005
msgid "Wait! At least listen to my sales pitch, meow!"
msgstr "等等！至少听听我的推销嘛，喵！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0x82ad76/0x000006
msgid "...Fine..."
msgstr "……好吧……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000000
msgid "On that island, there are undiscovered monsters that drop amazing stuff when you beat 'em."
msgstr "那座岛上有没被发现的怪物，打倒它们能掉超棒的东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000001
msgid "Stuff that's sure to be purr-ty handy... "
msgstr "那些东西肯定超好用……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000002
msgid "If you decide you want to have a look for yourself, select \"Hunting Quest\" from the Mission Select screen, meow."
msgstr "如果你决定想亲自去看看，在任务选择画面选“狩猎任务”，喵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xa2ad77/0x000003
msgid "I'll come and ferry you over."
msgstr "我会来接你过去。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000000
msgid "Sounds purrrfect!"
msgstr "太完美了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000001
msgid ""
"Now you're speaking my language, meow!\n"
"You and me are gonna get along great. "
msgstr "这才对嘛，喵！\n咱俩肯定合得来。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000002
msgid ""
" So, anytime you want to go on a Hunting Quest,\n"
"just give me a holler."
msgstr "所以，你想去狩猎任务的时候，\n喊我一声就行。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b090d/0xb2ad90/0x000003
msgid "Ta ta for meow!"
msgstr "喵喵再见！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b092d/0x32adf2/0x000000
msgid "Sorry to keep you waiting, meow."
msgstr "抱歉让你久等了，喵。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b092d/0x32adf2/0x000001
msgid "It's about time. Let's go, Trenya! "
msgstr "时候到了。走吧，Trenya！"

