#: slot/0x00420130/0x62697d/0x000000
msgid "Begin!"
msgstr "开始！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x626afd/0x000000
msgid "Again!"
msgstr "再来！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x626b7d/0x000000
msgid "Good!"
msgstr "很好！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x626bfd/0x000000
msgid "That's it!"
msgstr "就这样"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x626c7d/0x000000
msgid "I'll explain it again!"
msgstr "我再说明一次！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6277fd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00003b
msgid "What are you doing!"
msgstr "你在干什么！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6278fd/0x000000
msgid "Boss, please follow my directions."
msgstr "BOSS，请按我的指示做。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6279fd/0x000000
msgid "Please try it again, Boss."
msgstr "请再试一次，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x627a7d/0x000000
msgid "That is incorrect, Boss."
msgstr "不对，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x627afd/0x000000
msgid "Umm... Boss?"
msgstr "呃……BOSS？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x627b7d/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x628c7d/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x64b7fd/0x000000
msgid "Thank you, Boss."
msgstr "谢了，BOSS"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x627bfd/0x000000
msgid "Impressive, Boss!"
msgstr "漂亮，BOSS！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62887d/0x000000
msgid "Fantastic!"
msgstr "太棒了！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6289fd/0x000000
msgid "Moving on."
msgstr "继续。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x628a7d/0x000001
msgid "Time to move on."
msgstr "该继续了。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x628bfd/0x000000
msgid "Fine work, Boss."
msgstr "干得好，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6297fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Look alive, ladies! \n"
"The Boss is gonna join us! "
msgstr "打起精神，姑娘们！\nBOSS要来了！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62987d/0x000000
msgid "Show 'em how it's done, Boss."
msgstr "让她们见识下，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6298fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Your first priority in enemy \n"
"territory is knowing your surroundings."
msgstr "在敌区首要之事\n是掌握周围环境。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6298fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Your life depends on where you are looking\n"
"and how fast you can identify your target."
msgstr "你的命取决于你看向哪里\n以及多快锁定目标。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6298fd/0x000002
msgid ""
"Therefore, you must first \n"
"master moving your line of sight."
msgstr "因此，你必须先\n掌握移动视线。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62997d/0x000000
msgid ""
"To move your line of sight, \n"
"use the Camera Buttons."
msgstr "移动视线，\n使用镜头键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62997d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Now, when I give you an order, \n"
"look in that direction."
msgstr "现在，我下令时，\n就朝那个方向看。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6299fd/0x000000
msgid "Look up!"
msgstr "往上看！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629a7d/0x000000
msgid "Look down!"
msgstr "往下看！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629afd/0x000000
msgid "Look left!"
msgstr "往左看！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629b7d/0x000000
msgid "Look right!"
msgstr "往右看！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629bfd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x629c7d/0x000000
#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001ae
#: slot/0x00b9708c/0xa8181d/0x000007
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "怎么了？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629bfd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Use the up and down Camera Buttons \n"
"to move your line of sight!"
msgstr "用上下镜头键\n移动视线！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x629c7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Use the right and left Camera Buttons \n"
"to move your line of sight!"
msgstr "用左右镜头键\n移动视线！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a7fd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a87d/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x6458fe/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x6468fd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x6468fe/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x64ab7e/0x000000
msgid "Boss, "
msgstr "BOSS，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a7fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"use the up and down Camera Buttons \n"
"to move your line of sight.  "
msgstr "用上下镜头键\n移动视线。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a87d/0x000001
msgid ""
"use the left and right Camera Buttons \n"
"to move your line of sight.  "
msgstr "用左右镜头键\n移动视线。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a8fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"You should be familiar with the up \n"
"and down Camera Buttons now."
msgstr "你现在应该熟悉\n上下镜头键了。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a8fd/0x000001
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a97d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Action Button \n"
"if you're ready to move on."
msgstr "准备好了就按动作键\n继续。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62a97d/0x000000
msgid ""
"You should be familiar with \n"
"the left and right Camera Buttons now."
msgstr "你现在应该熟悉\n左右镜头键了。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62b7fd/0x000000
msgid "Next we'll check your left and right."
msgstr "接下来测试你的左右操作。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62b87d/0x000000
msgid "Now we'll check your up and down."
msgstr "测上下操作。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62b8fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Alright, we'll go over up and down with\n"
"the Camera Buttons one more time. "
msgstr "好，我们再用\n镜头键过一遍上下操作。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62b97d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Alright, we'll go over left and right with\n"
"the Camera Buttons one more time. "
msgstr "好，我们再用\n镜头键过一遍左右操作。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62b9fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"You can change the controls anytime \n"
"in Options. "
msgstr "你可以随时在\n设置里更改操作方式。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62ba7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Go with the method that works \n"
"best for you."
msgstr "选最适合你的\n方式就行。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bafd/0x000000
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "明白。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000000
msgid "Next I'll explain how to change stances."
msgstr "接下来说明如何切换姿势。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"If you just stand there \n"
"like an idiot in front of an enemy, "
msgstr "要是你像个傻瓜一样\n站在敌人面前，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000002
msgid "you might as well kill yourself now. "
msgstr "那还不如现在就自杀。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000003
msgid ""
"At times you will need to \n"
"get low to avoid detection. "
msgstr "有时你需要\n压低身位来躲避侦查。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000004
msgid ""
"You have three stances: \n"
"stand, crouch, and lying down."
msgstr "共有三种姿势：\n站、蹲、卧。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000005
msgid ""
"To change stances use \n"
"the Crouch Button. "
msgstr "用\n蹲伏键切换姿势。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000006
msgid ""
"Tap the Crouch Button to change \n"
"between standing and crouching."
msgstr "轻按蹲伏键切换\n站立与蹲伏。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000007
msgid "You can move in either stance."
msgstr "两种姿势都能移动。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000008
msgid ""
"Hold the Crouch Button \n"
"and keep it held to lie down."
msgstr "按住蹲伏键\n不放即可卧倒。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x000009
msgid ""
"However, you cannot move \n"
"while you are lying down."
msgstr "但卧倒时\n无法移动。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x00000a
msgid "I'll say that again!"
msgstr "我再说一遍！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bb7d/0x00000b
msgid ""
"You cannot move while lying down! \n"
"Is that clear?"
msgstr "卧倒时无法移动！\n听清楚了吗？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62bbfd/0x000000
msgid "Crouch!"
msgstr "蹲！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62c87d/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x64687e/0x000000
msgid "What are you doing? "
msgstr "你在干什么？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62c87d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Use the Crouch Button \n"
"to change your stance! "
msgstr "用蹲伏键\n切换姿势！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62c8fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, change your stance \n"
"with the Crouch Button!"
msgstr "BOSS，用蹲伏键\n切换姿势！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62c97d/0x000000
msgid "Next we'll work on your movement."
msgstr "接下来练习移动。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62c97d/0x000001
msgid "Use the analog stick to move around."
msgstr "用摇杆移动。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62c97d/0x000002
msgid ""
"Tilt it a little to walk slowly, \n"
"tilt it farther to run."
msgstr "轻推摇杆慢走，\n推到底则奔跑。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62c97d/0x000003
msgid ""
"Decide which to use \n"
"based on your situation."
msgstr "根据情况\n选择使用。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62c97d/0x000004
msgid ""
"Remember that your footsteps are louder\n"
"when running, making you easier to discover."
msgstr "记住奔跑时脚步声更大，\n更容易被发现。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62c97d/0x000005
msgid "Be careful!"
msgstr "小心！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62ca7d/0x000000
msgid "Run!"
msgstr "跑"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cafd/0x000000
msgid ""
"What now? \n"
"Use the analog stick to move! "
msgstr "怎么了？\n用摇杆移动！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cb7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, you can use \n"
"the analog stick to move!"
msgstr "BOSS，可以用\n摇杆移动！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfe/0x000000
msgid "Now we have rolling."
msgstr "会翻滚了"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfd/0x000001
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfe/0x000001
msgid ""
"Rolling is useful for knocking down \n"
"enemies in your way,  "
msgstr "翻滚能撞倒\n挡路的敌人，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfd/0x000002
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfe/0x000002
msgid "and for getting away when surrounded. "
msgstr "也能在被包围时脱身。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfd/0x000003
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfe/0x000003
msgid ""
"You can also use it to jump over \n"
"small ditches and other obstacles."
msgstr "还能用来跳过\n小沟等障碍。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfd/0x000004
msgid ""
"To roll, \n"
"tap the Attack Button while running. "
msgstr "翻滚：奔跑中\n轻按攻击键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfd/0x000005
msgid "You got that?"
msgstr "记住没？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfd/0x000006
msgid ""
"Tap the Attack Button \n"
"while running. Don't forget it!"
msgstr "奔跑中轻按攻击键。\n别忘了！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfe/0x000004
msgid ""
"To roll, tap the \n"
"Crouch Button while running."
msgstr "翻滚：奔跑中\n轻按蹲伏键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfe/0x000005
msgid "You got that? "
msgstr "记住没？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62cbfe/0x000006
msgid ""
"Tap the Crouch Button \n"
"while running. Don't forget it! "
msgstr "奔跑中轻按蹲伏键。\n别忘了！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d7fd/0x000000
msgid "Roll!"
msgstr "翻滚！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d87d/0x000000
msgid "What's wrong?!"
msgstr "咋了？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d87d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Run with the analog stick, \n"
"then tap the Attack Button to roll!  "
msgstr "用摇杆奔跑，\n再轻按攻击键翻滚！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d87e/0x000000
msgid "What's wrong?! "
msgstr "怎么了？！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d87e/0x000001
msgid ""
"Run with the analog stick, \n"
"then tap the Crouch Button to roll!"
msgstr "用摇杆奔跑，\n再轻按蹲伏键翻滚！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d8fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, roll by tapping the Attack Button\n"
"while  running with the analog stick! "
msgstr "BOSS，用摇杆奔跑时\n轻按攻击键翻滚！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d8fe/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, roll by tapping the Crouch Button\n"
"while running with the analog stick!"
msgstr "BOSS，用摇杆奔跑时\n轻按蹲伏键翻滚！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d97d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Next, I will explain \n"
"how to attack without gunfire."
msgstr "接下来讲解\n如何不开枪攻击。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d97d/0x000001
msgid ""
"You may run into \n"
"an enemy unexpectedly."
msgstr "你可能会意外\n遭遇敌人。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d97d/0x000002
msgid "You may not have a weapon on you. "
msgstr "你身上可能没有武器。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d97d/0x000003
msgid "Or you may be out of ammo. "
msgstr "或者弹药耗尽。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d97d/0x000004
msgid ""
"You'll still need an effective \n"
"attack strategy. "
msgstr "你仍需要有效的\n攻击策略。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d97d/0x000005
msgid ""
"One well-placed strike and the enemy \n"
"won't know what hit him! "
msgstr "一记精准打击，敌人\n根本不知道被什么击中！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d9fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"To strike an enemy, press \n"
"the Attack Button while standing still! "
msgstr "要攻击敌人，站立不动时\n按攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d9fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"On my command, press the Attack Button\n"
"repeatedly and take down your opponent!"
msgstr "听我口令，连续按攻击键\n击倒对手！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d9fe/0x000000
msgid ""
"To strike an enemy, press the Hand-to-hand\n"
"Attack Button while standing still!"
msgstr "要攻击敌人，站立不动时\n按徒手攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d9fe/0x000001
msgid "On my command, "
msgstr "听我口令，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62d9fe/0x000002
msgid ""
"press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button\n"
"repeatedly and take down your opponent!"
msgstr "连续按徒手攻击键\n击倒对手！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dafd/0x000000
msgid "You alright, boss? "
msgstr "你没事吧，BOSS？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dafd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Attack Button \n"
"without moving!  "
msgstr "不要移动，\n按攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dafe/0x000000
msgid "You alright, boss?"
msgstr "你没事吧，BOSS？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dafe/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand \n"
"Attack Button without moving!  "
msgstr "不要移动，\n按徒手攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62db7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Press the Attack Button without \n"
"moving, Boss. "
msgstr "不要移动，\n按攻击键，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62db7e/0x000000
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"without moving, Boss. "
msgstr "不要移动，\n按徒手攻击键，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dbfd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Next we're gonna practice using \n"
"the stun rod."
msgstr "接下来练习使用\n电击棒。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dbfd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Hitting someone with the stun rod will\n"
"shock them with a million and a half volts."
msgstr "用电击棒击中对方，\n会以一百五十万伏特电击他。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dbfd/0x000002
msgid ""
"Anyone on the receiving end of that is\n"
"guaranteed to be out cold."
msgstr "挨上这一下的人\n保证会昏过去。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dc7d/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dc7e/0x000000
msgid ""
"To use the stun rod, \n"
"press the Aim Button to ready it,"
msgstr "使用电击棒时，\n按瞄准键举起，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dc7d/0x000001
msgid "then press the Attack Button."
msgstr "然后按攻击键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dc7d/0x000002
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dc7e/0x000002
msgid ""
"You'll be glad to know we're using \n"
"mock stun rods for this training session."
msgstr "这次训练用的是\n模拟电击棒，你可以放心。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dc7d/0x000003
msgid ""
"When your partner attacks, \n"
"make him believe it's the real deal. "
msgstr "搭档攻击时，\n要让他觉得是真的。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dc7d/0x000004
#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dc7e/0x000004
msgid "Prepare yourself for stun rod training!"
msgstr "准备好接受电击棒训练！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dc7e/0x000001
msgid "then press the Weapon-Attack Button."
msgstr "然后按武器攻击键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x62dc7e/0x000003
msgid ""
"When your partner attacks, \n"
"make him believe it's the real deal."
msgstr "搭档攻击时，\n要让他以为这是真的。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64487d/0x000000
msgid "Hey, hey! Hold down the Aim Button!"
msgstr "喂喂！按住瞄准键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64487e/0x000000
msgid "Hey! Press the Aim Button!"
msgstr "喂！按瞄准键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6448fd/0x000000
msgid "Boss, please hold down the Aim Button!"
msgstr "BOSS，请按住瞄准键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6448fe/0x000000
msgid "Boss, please press the Aim Button!"
msgstr "BOSS，请按瞄准键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64497d/0x000000
msgid "Strike!"
msgstr "打！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6449fd/0x000000
msgid "Let him have it!"
msgstr "上啊！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644a7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"What's wrong? Press the Attack Button\n"
"while holding down the Aim Button! "
msgstr "怎么了？按住瞄准键\n再按攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644a7e/0x000000
msgid ""
"What's wrong? Press the Attack Button\n"
"after pressing the Aim Button! "
msgstr "怎么了？按瞄准键后\n再按攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644afd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, please press the Attack Button \n"
"while holding down the Aim Button!"
msgstr "BOSS，请按住瞄准键\n再按攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644afe/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, please press the Attack Button \n"
"after pressing the Aim Button! "
msgstr "BOSS，请按瞄准键后\n再按攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644b7d/0x000000
msgid "Now we'll move on to CQC."
msgstr "接下来讲CQC。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644b7d/0x000001
msgid "CQC, or close quarters combat, "
msgstr "CQC，即近身格斗，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644b7d/0x000002
msgid ""
"refers to when engaging an enemy in \n"
"battle at very close range.  "
msgstr "指在极近距离与敌人\n交战时使用。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644b7d/0x000003
msgid ""
"It is a quick and efficient way of \n"
"eliminating a threat."
msgstr "是迅速高效地\n消除威胁的手段。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644b7d/0x000004
msgid ""
"There are various CQC techniques. \n"
"We will go over each of them."
msgstr "CQC技法多样。\n我们逐一讲解。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644b7d/0x000005
msgid ""
"Don't get cocky because you think \n"
"you know them. "
msgstr "别因为你觉得\n了解他们就得意忘形。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644b7d/0x000006
msgid ""
"This will be different from what \n"
"you're used to."
msgstr "这和你以往\n所学的不同。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644b7d/0x000007
msgid ""
"Pretend you are learning it all for \n"
"the first time."
msgstr "就当自己\n从零开始学。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644b7d/0x000008
msgid "The first technique..."
msgstr "第一个技法……"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644b7d/0x000009
msgid "...is throwing your opponent."
msgstr "……是将对手摔倒。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644bfd/0x000000
msgid "To do this,"
msgstr "为此，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644bfd/0x000001
msgid "position yourself near your opponent "
msgstr "靠近对手"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644bfd/0x000002
msgid ""
"and press the Attack Button \n"
"while you tilt the analog stick."
msgstr "推动摇杆的同时\n按攻击键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644bfd/0x000003
#: slot/0x00420130/0x644bfe/0x000002
msgid ""
"Be sure to press the Attack Button \n"
"when the Icon appears."
msgstr "图标出现时\n务必按攻击键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644bfd/0x000004
msgid ""
"Now, wait for my command \n"
"and throw your opponent."
msgstr "现在，等我的指令\n把对手摔出去。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644bfe/0x000000
msgid ""
"To do this, position yourself\n"
"near your opponent"
msgstr "要做到这点，站到\n对手附近"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644bfe/0x000001
msgid ""
"and press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button\n"
"as you tilt the analog stick."
msgstr "然后一边推摇杆\n一边按徒手攻击键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644bfe/0x000003
msgid ""
"Now, wait for my command \n"
"and throw your opponent. "
msgstr "现在，等我的指令\n把对手摔出去。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x644c7d/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x64787d/0x000000
msgid "Throw!"
msgstr "摔！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6457fd/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x6457fe/0x000000
msgid "Hey! "
msgstr "嘿"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6457fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Attack Button \n"
"as you tilt the analog stick! "
msgstr "一边推摇杆\n一边按攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6457fe/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"as you tilt the analog stick! "
msgstr "一边推摇杆\n一边按徒手攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64587d/0x000000
msgid "Watch for the Icon to appear!"
msgstr "注意图标出现！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6458fd/0x000000
msgid "Boss,"
msgstr "BOSS"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6458fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press the Attack Button \n"
"as you tilt the analog stick!  "
msgstr "你得一边推摇杆\n一边按攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6458fe/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press the Hand-to-hand Action\n"
"Button as you tilt the analog stick!"
msgstr "你得一边推摇杆\n一边按徒手攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64597d/0x000000
msgid "Don't forget to watch for the Icon!"
msgstr "别忘了注意图标！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6459fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Next I'm going to teach you how to \n"
"restrain an opponent close to you."
msgstr "接下来我教你如何\n制住靠近你的对手。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6459fd/0x000001
msgid "This is a cornerstone of CQC."
msgstr "这是CQC的基石。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6459fd/0x000002
msgid ""
"Grab hold of an enemy and \n"
"the bastard's life is in your hands. "
msgstr "抓住敌人，\n那家伙的命就在你手里。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6459fd/0x000003
msgid "What you do from there is up to you."
msgstr "接下来怎么做随你。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x645a7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Just know that if you restrain him \n"
"for too long,"
msgstr "只是要知道，如果制住他\n太久，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x645a7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"the average person will most likely \n"
"pass out."
msgstr "一般人多半会\n昏过去。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x645a7d/0x000002
msgid "Something to keep in mind."
msgstr "这点要记住。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x645b7d/0x000000
msgid "Let's begin."
msgstr "开始吧。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x645bfd/0x000000
msgid "To restrain your opponent, "
msgstr "要制住对手，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x645bfd/0x000001
msgid ""
"hold down the Attack Button \n"
"while near them. "
msgstr "靠近他们时\n按住攻击键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x645bfd/0x000002
msgid "Restrain your opponent on my command."
msgstr "听我指令制住对手。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x645bfe/0x000000
msgid "To restrain your opponent,"
msgstr "要制住对手，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x645bfe/0x000001
msgid ""
"hold down the Hand-to-hand \n"
"Attack Button while near them. "
msgstr "靠近敌人时按住徒手\n攻击键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x645bfe/0x000002
msgid ""
"Restrain your opponent \n"
"on my command. "
msgstr "按我的指令\n压制你的对手。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64687d/0x000000
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "你在干什么？"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64687d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Attack Button \n"
"while near your opponent! "
msgstr "靠近对手时\n按下攻击按钮！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64687e/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"while near your opponent! "
msgstr "靠近对手时\n按下格斗攻击按钮！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6468fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press the Attack Button \n"
"while next to your opponent! "
msgstr "你必须在对手旁边时\n按下攻击按钮！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6468fe/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press the Hand-to-hand \n"
"Attack Button while next to your opponent!"
msgstr "你得在对手旁边按徒手\n攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x646afd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Now we will throw your opponent after\n"
"restraining them. "
msgstr "现在我们会先压制你的对手，\n然后把他摔出去。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x646b7d/0x000000
msgid "To throw an enemy to the ground, "
msgstr "要把敌人摔倒在地，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x646b7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"press a direction on the analog stick \n"
"when you have them restrained. "
msgstr "当你压制住他们时\n在摇杆上按一个方向。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x646c7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Restrain your opponent \n"
"and throw them on my command."
msgstr "按我的指令压制你的对手\n并把他摔出去。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6479fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Some enemies will no doubt possess \n"
"useful information."
msgstr "有些敌人肯定掌握着\n有用的情报。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6479fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"I'll now teach you how to interrogate \n"
"an enemy to obtain such information."
msgstr "现在教你如何审问敌人\n获取这些情报。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x647a7d/0x000000
#: slot/0x00420130/0x647a7e/0x000000
msgid "To interrogate someone, "
msgstr "要审问敌人，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x647a7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"press the Attack Button to restrain \n"
"them, then press the Action Button. "
msgstr "按下攻击按钮来压制\n他们，然后按下动作按钮。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x647a7d/0x000002
#: slot/0x00420130/0x647a7e/0x000002
msgid ""
"On my command, restrain and \n"
"then interrogate your opponent. "
msgstr "按我的指令，压制\n然后审问你的对手。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x647a7e/0x000001
msgid ""
"press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button\n"
"torestrain them, then press the R button."
msgstr "按下格斗攻击按钮\n来压制他们，然后按下R按钮。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x647afd/0x000000
msgid "Restrain him!"
msgstr "制服他！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x647b7d/0x000000
msgid "Interrogate!"
msgstr "审问！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x647bfd/0x000000
msgid "You OK? Press the Action Button!"
msgstr "没事吧？按动作键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x647bfe/0x000000
msgid "You OK? Press the R button!"
msgstr "没事吧？按R键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x647c7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"You have to press the Action Button, \n"
"Boss!"
msgstr "你必须按下动作按钮，\n老大！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x647c7e/0x000000
msgid "Boss, you have to press the R button!"
msgstr "BOSS，你得按R键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64887d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Now we will try CQC against multiple \n"
"enemy opponents. "
msgstr "现在我们要尝试对多个\n敌方对手进行CQC。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6488fd/0x000000
msgid "I need a volunteer to step forward."
msgstr "我需要一名志愿者出列。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x648afd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Like before, \n"
"wait for the Icon to appear."
msgstr "和之前一样，\n等图标出现。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x648afd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Now, \n"
"throw your opponent on my command."
msgstr "现在，\n听我口令摔出对手。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6499fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"You can also take out a group \n"
"of enemies "
msgstr "你还能一次干掉\n一群敌人，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x6499fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"by throwing an opponent \n"
"you have restrained."
msgstr "把已制服对手\n摔向他们。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"First restrain an opponent by pressing \n"
"the Attack Button near them."
msgstr "先靠近对手按\n攻击键将其制服。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Then tilt the analog stick \n"
"to throw them."
msgstr "然后推摇杆\n把他摔出去。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7d/0x000002
msgid ""
"By tilting the analog stick toward \n"
"other enemies, "
msgstr "把摇杆推向\n其他敌人，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7d/0x000003
#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7e/0x000003
msgid ""
"you can send your captive flying \n"
"straight into them! "
msgstr "就能把抓住的敌人\n直直砸向他们！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7d/0x000004
msgid ""
"On my command, \n"
"restrain and then throw your opponent. "
msgstr "听我口令，\n先制服再摔出对手。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7e/0x000000
msgid ""
"First restrain an opponent by pressing the\n"
"Hand-to-hand Attack Button while near them."
msgstr "先靠近对手按\n徒手攻击键将其制服。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7e/0x000001
msgid ""
"Then tilt the analog stick \n"
"to throw them. "
msgstr "然后推摇杆\n把他摔出去。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7e/0x000002
msgid ""
"By tilting the analog stick toward \n"
"other enemies,  "
msgstr "把摇杆推向\n其他敌人，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649a7e/0x000004
msgid ""
"On my command, \n"
"restrain and then throw your opponent."
msgstr "听我口令，\n先制服再摔出对手。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x649bfd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Tilt the analog stick while \n"
"restraining the opponent! "
msgstr "制服对手时\n推摇杆！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a7fd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Tilt the analog stick while restraining \n"
"the opponent, Boss!"
msgstr "制服对手时推摇杆，\nBOSS！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a8fd/0x000000
msgid "Alright..."
msgstr "好吧…"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a8fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Why don't we do something special \n"
"since the Boss is here."
msgstr "既然BOSS来了，\n不如来点特别的。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a8fd/0x000002
msgid ""
"Anyone who feels like getting their \n"
"ass kicked, step forward. "
msgstr "想挨揍的\n就站出来。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a8fd/0x000003
msgid "Don't hold back, Boss."
msgstr "别留手，BOSS。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a97d/0x000000
msgid ""
"When you're surrounded\n"
"by multiple enemies, "
msgstr "被多个敌人\n包围时，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a97d/0x000001
msgid ""
"you'll have to take them on one \n"
"after the other."
msgstr "你得一个接一个\n对付他们。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a97d/0x000002
#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a97e/0x000002
msgid "To do it, "
msgstr "方法："

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a97d/0x000003
msgid ""
"simply press the Attack Button again \n"
"while throwing the current enemy.  "
msgstr "摔出当前敌人时\n再按一次攻击键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a97d/0x000004
#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a97e/0x000004
msgid ""
"Just be sure to wait for the Icon \n"
"to appear. "
msgstr "一定要等图标\n出现。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a97e/0x000000
msgid ""
"When you're surrounded \n"
"by multiple enemies, "
msgstr "被多个敌人\n包围时，"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a97e/0x000001
msgid ""
"you'll have to take them on one \n"
"after the other. "
msgstr "你得一个接一个\n对付他们。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64a97e/0x000003
msgid ""
"simply press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button\n"
"again while throwing the current enemy."
msgstr "扔出当前敌人时，\n再按一次徒手攻击键。"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64aafd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Press the Attack Button \n"
"when the Icon appears!"
msgstr "图标出现时\n按攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64aafe/0x000000
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"when the Icon appears! "
msgstr "图标出现时\n按徒手攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64ab7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, press the Attack Button \n"
"when the Icon appears!"
msgstr "BOSS，图标出现时\n按攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64ab7e/0x000001
msgid ""
"press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"when the Icon appears! "
msgstr "图标出现时\n按徒手攻击键！"

#: slot/0x00420130/0x64abfd/0x000000
msgid "And stop!"
msgstr "停！"

